Verdict  RISKY: 4 risky features found

Findings
  Runs a script when the file is opened
      JavaScript that other PDF viewers may run as soon as the document opens. Vellora never runs PDF JavaScript.
  Contains JavaScript actions
      Scripts attached to links, buttons, form fields or bookmarks.
  Can start a program or open a file
      A Launch action asks a viewer to start another program or open a file on your computer.
  Has embedded files
      Files attached inside the PDF; opening one can run whatever program handles its type.

